*Product 0:** a lost sale costs about 13 (12 revenue + 5 penalty − 4 purchase). Over-ordering costs about 4 plus holding, because excess eventually spoils. The best level is roughly the 68% demand quantile, about 1.15–1.2 × the forecast.\n- **Product 1:** a lost sale costs about 12, and an excess unit about 10. The best level is about 1.05–1.1 × the forecast.\n\n**How the candidates compare to those targets:**\n- **Candidate 5:** about 1.2× for product 0 and 1.1× for product 1, closest to both targets.\n- **Candidate 7:** about 1.34× and 1.2×, so it over-orders and loses more to spoilage.\n- **Candidate 3:** about 1.3× and 1.0×, so product 1 runs short.\n- **Daily plans:**\n  - Candidate 6 (about 1.26× and 1.1×) is close to the targets.\n  - Candidate 1 (about 1.04×) orders too little.\n  - Candidates 0 and 4 order too much of product 0.\n\nCandidate 5 combines the right frequency with the right order sizes. Candidates 6 and 7 come close, which is why my confidence is only moderate."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4380, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4380}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-14T17:17:46.973Z", "request_id": "req_011Cg2WUj7H28W5ekfEy17nT"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01NeZn6JNSSYB8DxyCVJDaPb", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cg2WUjZKv6tGihV